abstract: >-
  A student-oriented Google Colab notebook for exploring CNN layers and
  epochs with MNIST, and visualizing external handwritten-digit images
  using Grad-CAM++ with analytic second- and third-order derivatives of the exponential class score for a piecewise-linear classifier.
keywords:
  - explainable artificial intelligence
  - Grad-CAM++
  - CNN
  - MNIST
  - technology education
